@theblackinthehat DJ Eric Visa in the house! December Edition at Reserve is about to light up with culture, rhythm, and real groove. RAAM BAND @raambandmusic joins the night for a fusion of Afro-house and timeless vibes. 7 PM – 12 AM at The Living Room. Let’s make it unforgettable.

The energy keeps evolving — new rhythms, deeper grooves, and sounds inspired by cultures across the world. Every track is crafted to move the crowd, lift the spirit, and create a moment that stays long after the music stops. 🌍🔥

